# Development and CI dependencies — hand-written source manifest.
#
# requirements-dev.txt is compiled from this file:
#   uv pip compile requirements-dev.in --constraint requirements.txt -o requirements-dev.txt
#
# The --constraint keeps transitive pins shared with the runtime tier on the
# same versions, so `pip-sync requirements.txt requirements-dev.txt` never
# sees conflicting pins for one package. pip-sync requires every manifest it
# syncs to be a fully compiled closure: it uninstalls anything that is not an
# explicit pin, so hand-written manifests orphan their transitive dependencies.
#
# Install development environment: scripts/sync-deps.sh dev
#   (or: pip install -r requirements.txt -r requirements-dev.txt)

